From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: satyaidk <nikadisatyanarayana@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 02:18:45 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] mqtt_ha: fix configure with CONFIG_MQTT_HOMEASSISTANT
 disabled

With the option off the component registers no sources, so
COMPONENT_LIB is an INTERFACE library and the unconditional
target_compile_options(... PRIVATE -Os) aborts CMake with
"target_compile_options may only set INTERFACE properties on
INTERFACE targets". Guard it the way components/oled_display does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 components/mqtt_ha/CMakeLists.txt | 6 +++++-
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/components/mqtt_ha/CMakeLists.txt b/components/mqtt_ha/CMakeLists.txt
index f11c6ce..b802e72 100644
--- a/components/mqtt_ha/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/components/mqtt_ha/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -9,4 +9,8 @@ idf_component_register(
     INCLUDE_DIRS "include"
     PRIV_REQUIRES mqtt esp_event esp_wifi esp_netif esp_timer nvs_flash console cmd_router remote_console
 )
-target_compile_options(${COMPONENT_LIB} PRIVATE -Os)
+# Without sources the component is an INTERFACE library, which cannot take
+# PRIVATE options (same guard as components/oled_display).
+if(MQTT_HA_SRCS)
+    target_compile_options(${COMPONENT_LIB} PRIVATE -Os)
+endif()
